            <ArticleTitle>[Extraction, separation and quantitative determination of prostaglandins in blood, thrombocytes and several tissues].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>514-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Modified methods, using selective organic extraction and absorption-distributional column chromatography, are described for isolation of prostglandines with high yield; the substances were differentiated by means of the methods used into series A, E, F. Use of radioimmunologic method enabled to obtain data on content of prostglandines in blood plasma and in thrombocytes of healthy people and of patients with ischemic heart impairments as well as on content of these substances in rabbit blood plasma, fatty and livery tissues.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
